Package: MCMSEM
Type: Package
Title: Multi Co-Moment Structural Equation Models
Version: 0.27.0
Author: Zenab Tamimy, Elsje van Bergen, Matthijs van der Zee, Conor Dolan, Michel Nivard
Maintainer: Zenab Tamimy <z.tamimy@vu.nl>
Description: Provides structural and stationary dynamic models for
    cross-sectional data from non-normally distributed variables. The method
    extends covariance structural equation modeling with multivariate higher
    moments, including co-skewnesses and co-kurtoses, that can inform direction
    under explicit identification assumptions.
